The '''Emerald Sea''' was an [[ocean]] located on the [[planet]] [[Savareen]]. It was located at the edge of<ref name="Solo Expanded Edition" /> the [[Pnakotic Coast]], on which the [[Bis Refinery]] and a [[Savarian]] [[Pnakotic Coast village|village]] were located.<ref name="Solo TOG">''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story The Official Guide]]''</ref>

